WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:14.480
What did you do yesterday?

2
00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:17.240
I did many things.

3
00:00:18.070 --> 00:00:20.890
I went shopping.

4
00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:23.770
What did you buy?

5
00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:26.770
I bought new clothes.

6
00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:30.100
What else did you do?

7
00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:33.490
I also played tennis.

8
00:00:33.490 --> 00:00:36.280
Who did you play with?

9
00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:39.260
I played with Tom.

10
00:00:39.960 --> 00:00:42.330
Did you win?

11
00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:45.340
Yes, I won!

12
00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:57.690
What did you do yesterday?

13
00:00:58.010 --> 00:01:00.510
I went to the park.

14
00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:03.900
It was a sunny day.

15
00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:07.730
That sounds nice.

16
00:01:07.990 --> 00:01:10.740
Did you go alone?

17
00:01:10.940 --> 00:01:14.460
No, I went there with John.

18
00:01:14.450 --> 00:01:17.070
We had ice cream.

19
00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:20.730
Ice cream is my favorite!

20
00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:23.480
Which flavor did you have?

21
00:01:23.890 --> 00:01:26.350
I had chocolate.

22
00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:28.600
John had vanilla.

23
00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:30.690
Yummy!

24
00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:42.920
Did you watch the movie last night?

25
00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:45.480
Yes, I did.

26
00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:48.550
It was amazing!

27
00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:49.960
Really?

28
00:01:49.950 --> 00:01:52.190
What was it about?

29
00:01:52.450 --> 00:01:56.350
It was a movie about space travel.

30
00:01:57.950 --> 00:02:00.060
That sounds interesting.

31
00:02:00.070 --> 00:02:03.010
Who did you watch it with?

32
00:02:03.460 --> 00:02:06.280
I watched it with my sister.

33
00:02:06.280 --> 00:02:08.840
She loved it too.

34
00:02:09.030 --> 00:02:11.270
Cool!
